{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Tales from the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Qualified or Not?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>A <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> is a verb ending with <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> (<span class=\"italic\">doing</span>).<br/>An <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span> is <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + verb (<span class=\"italic\">to do</span>).</p>There are rules about which verbs you can use with gerunds and which verbs you can use with infinitives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Verbs commonly followed by a gerund:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Verbs that express <span class=\"strong\">likes/dislikes</span>:<ul><li>like</li><li>love</li><li>enjoy</li><li>dislike</li><li>hate</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Tom <span class=\"strong\">disliked confronting</span> people about money. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The verbs <span class=\"italic\">like</span>/<span class=\"italic\">love</span>/<span class=\"italic\">hate</span> can also be followed by an infinitive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other verbs that are followed by a gerund:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>anticipate</li><li>consider</li><li>delay</li><li>complete</li><li>involve</li><li>suggest</li><li>risk</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use gerunds after prepositions: <br/><ul><li><span class=\"italic\">interested <span class=\"strong\">in</span> </li> <li>good <span class=\"strong\">at </span></li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm <span class=\"strong\">interested in sharing</span> my knowledge with the younger generations.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are some verbs that are followed by an infinitive:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>hope</li><li>proceed</li><li>seem</li><li>decide</li><li>start</li><li>would love</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">would love to do</span> a nature walk or go hiking with them.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use Infinitives after adjectives. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm <span class=\"strong\">pleased to meet</span> you.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Thank you for seeing me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm pleased to meet you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'd like to work as a camp counselor over the summer. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm interested in sharing my knowledge with the younger generations. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hope to inspire them to maybe one day pursue a career in science. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Conversations in a Work Environment", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When talking at work, there are several scenarios that may arise, each with their own sets of functional language.<br/> You may have to meet someone new, have small talk, ask follow up questions or end a conversation politely. All of these things help to build professional relationships.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Small talk</span> is light conversation to create a friendly feeling between people. Topics are usually about the weather, news or sports - things that are considered \u201csafe\u201d or neutral.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">It's a beautiful day today, isn't it?<br/>Yes, it's a lovely spring day. <br/>How about those New York Yankees?<br/>Did you hear about the robbery downtown?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for examples of other kinds of workplace functional language.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Functional Language\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meeting someone new\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm pleased to meet you. <br/>Thank you for coming in today. <br/>Thank you for seeing me.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Keeping the conversation going\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you tell me more about what you do here? <br/>Can you tell me about your experience?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ending the conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Well, it was a pleasure meeting you. Here is my card. <br/>Thank you. I'm looking forward to speaking with you again.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be familiar with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to know something or someone well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you familiar with the agency at all?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "candidate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who applies for a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Temporary Work Now is an employment agency that places young candidates in temporary jobs. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "camp counselor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who has supervisory duties at a summer camp for children", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to work as a camp counselor over the summer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "laboratory ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place where scientists perform experiments", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've worked in a science laboratory for the last four years. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "teaching assistant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who helps a teacher", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "xample: I've also worked as a teaching assistant since graduating. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "child-related", "type": "name"}, {"content": "related to children", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So, you don't have any child-related experience? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "considerable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a lot", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've had considerable experience working with animals and books.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pursue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to seek to attain or accomplish a goal, especially over a long period", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope to inspire them to maybe one day pursue a career in science. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nature walk", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a walk on a nature trail with an experienced guide", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd love to do a nature walk or go hiking with them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "collage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of art made by sticking various different materials onto a backing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would have them create a collage with interesting leaves they find.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob02aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write down three different jobs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of qualifications you need to do each job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Put your lists of qualifications for each job in order of most important to least important.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your ideas in a conversation with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I list job qualifications and put them in order of most to least important.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I keep the conversation going with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: Welcome to TWN, Ms. Mathison. I'm pleased to meet you. It's a beautiful day today, isn't it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: Yes, it's a lovely spring day. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: Thank you for coming in today. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: Thank you for seeing me. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: Are you familiar with the agency at all?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: I've read a little online. Could you tell me more about what you do here?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: Of course. TWN, or Temporary Work Now, is an employment agency that places young candidates in temporary jobs. What kind of work are you looking for? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: Well, I'd like to work as a camp counselor over the summer."}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: I see. Can you tell me about your experience working with children? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: Um ... I've worked in a science laboratory for the last four years. I've also worked as a teaching assistant since graduating. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: So, you don't have any child-related experience? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: As you can see, I've had considerable experience working with animals and books, but I'm interested in sharing my knowledge with the younger generations. I hope to inspire them to maybe one day pursue a career in science. <br/>"}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob02re2img03.jpg", "time": "56200", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: I see. I'd like to hear an idea for an activity you would do with the kids, if you were hired. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: I'd love to do a nature walk or go hiking with them and have them create a collage with interesting leaves they find.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. White</span>: Well, it was a pleasure meeting you, Ms. Mathison. Here is my card. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Mathison</span>: Thank you. I'm looking forward to speaking with you again."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le06ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le06ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, rules and regulations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can keep a conversation going and build a professional relationship. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who do you usually have small talk with? What do you talk about?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you like going to job interviews? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Could you tell me more about what you do here?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Ms. Mathison has a job interview. What kind of <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">agency</span> does she visit?", "type": "text"}], "type": 